# Expenses Analyzer

- Follow `.specify/memory/constitution.md` and `AGENTS.md`.
- Full rewrite; monorepo with backend + frontend; stack is recorded in `STACK.md`.
- Use Spec Kit skills (`speckit-*`) for feature work. Do not invent product behavior outside an approved spec.
- Global rules: `docs/PRODUCT.md`. Delivery: `specs/` slice. Then **test-first**, then implement. Do not code from PRODUCT.md alone.
